Use this API to create a Stock Transfer Order (STO) from a warehouse to a retail store.

 Copy & Paste the JSON below in the Request Body: 

 Plain Text {
 \"b2b_order\": {
 \"to_warehouse_code\": \"WH001\",
 \"is_stock_transfer\": true,
 \"destination_store_code\": \"STORE001\",
 \"carrier\": {
 \"carrier_code\": \"CARR001\",
 \"carrier_name\": \"DHL\"
 },
 \"order_items_attributes\": [
 {
 \"sku\": \"PROD-001\",
 \"quantity\": 100
 }
 ]
 }
 }
 STO Order with VAS: 

 Plain Text {
 \"b2b_order\": {
 \"to_warehouse_code\": \"WH001\",
 \"is_stock_transfer\": true,
 \"destination_store_code\": \"STORE001\",
 \"order_vas\": [\"Quality Check\"],
 \"carrier\": { \"carrier_code\": \"CARR001\", \"carrier_name\": \"DHL\" },
 \"order_items_attributes\": [
 {
 \"sku\": \"PROD-001\",
 \"quantity\": 100,
 \"sku_vas\": [\"Labeling\"]
 }
 ]
 }
 }
 VAS Parameters: 
Prerequisite: vas_enabled must be ON. If disabled, VAS params are ignored.

 order_vas - VAS codes/names at order level (array or comma-separated string) 
 sku_vas - VAS codes/names at item level 
 Note:

 STO orders do NOT support

 order gift message

 ,

 sku gift message

 , or

 sku etching message

 .

