Use this API to create a new consignment (Purchase Order/ASN) for a specific customer/company in the Anchanto WMS. By making a POST request to this endpoint, you can provide the necessary information for creating a new consignment including supplier details, items, and shipping information.

 Consignment with VAS: 

 Plain Text {
 "consignment": {
 "supplier_code": "SUP001",
 "number": "PO-2024-002",
 "order_type": "PO",
 "ship_date": "2024-01-15",
 "receiving_date": "2024-01-20",
 "po_vas": ["Quality Check", "Labeling"],
 "consignment_items_attributes": [
 {
 "sku": "PROD-001",
 "quantity": 100,
 "item_vas": ["Repackaging"]
 }
 ],
 "consignment_vas_attributes": { "price_tag_selected": true }
 }
 }
 VAS Parameters: 
Prerequisite: vas_enabled must be ON. If disabled, VAS params are ignored.

 po_vas - VAS codes/names at consignment/PO level (array or comma-separated string) 
 item_vas - VAS codes/names at item level (inside consignment items attributes) 
 Note:

 Consignments do NOT support gift/etching message parameters.

Use this API to update an existing consignment for a specific customer/company in the Anchanto WMS.

 Copy & Paste the JSON below in the Request Body: 

 Plain Text {
 \"consignment\": {
 \"number\": \"PO-2024-001\",
 \"supplier_code\": \"SUP-001\",
 \"expected_delivery_date\": \"2024-12-31\",
 \"consignment_items_attributes\": [
 {
 \"sku\": \"PROD-001\",
 \"quantity\": 150,
 \"unit_price\": 10.50
 }
 ]
 }
 }
 Update Consignment with VAS: 

 Plain Text {
 \"consignment\": {
 \"number\": \"PO-2024-001\",
 \"po_vas\": [\"Quality Check\"],
 \"consignment_items_attributes\": [
 {
 \"sku\": \"PROD-001\",
 \"quantity\": 150,
 \"item_vas\": [\"Repackaging\"]
 }
 ]
 }
 }
 Update Existing/Delete Items: 

 Plain Text {
 "consignment": {
 "number": "PO-2024-001",
 "consignment_items_attributes": [
 {
 "line_number": 1,
 "quantity": 200
 },
 {
 "line_number": 2,
 "delete_item": true
 }
 ]
 }
 }
 VAS Parameters: 
Prerequisite: vas_enabled must be ON. If disabled, VAS params are ignored.

 po_vas - VAS codes/names at consignment level. Replaces existing VAS on update. Send blank to clear. 
 item_vas - VAS codes/names at item level. Replaces existing VAS on update. 
 IMPORTANT:

 Use line_number to target specific items for update or deletion. 
 To delete an item, set delete_item: true along with its line_number . 
 New items are added if no line_number is provided. 
 Note: Consignments do NOT support gift/etching message parameters.

